# Repository API Endpoints

## Endpoints Covered
- `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}` — Get repository
- `GET /orgs/{org}/repos` — List org repos
- `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/branches` — List branches
- `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/tags` — List tags
- `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/contributors` — List contributors
- `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/languages` — List languages
- `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/readme` — Get README
- `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/commits` — List commits

## Test Data
- Primary fixture: `octocat/Hello-World`
- Popular repos for parameterized tests: linux, vscode, react, tensorflow
- Constants in `data/repos_constants.py`

## Test Files
- `tests/repos/test_get_repo.py` — Single repo retrieval, schema, known values
- `tests/repos/test_list_repos.py` — Listing, pagination, filtering
